{"suttaId":"tha-ap411","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[13732,13891],"vripara":"276"},"segments":{"tha-ap411:0.3":"Jatukaṇṇittheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap411:1.1":"“Nagare haṃsavatiyā,","tha-ap411:1.2":"seṭṭhiputto ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap411:1.3":"Samappito kāmaguṇe,","tha-ap411:1.4":"paricāremahaṃ tadā. 277.","tha-ap411:2.1":"“Tato [tayo (sī.)] pāsādamāruyha,","tha-ap411:2.2":"mahābhoge valañjako [ubbiddhā gehaluñjakā (ka.), ubbiddhāgehalañchakā (sī.)];","tha-ap411:2.3":"Tattha naccehi gītehi,","tha-ap411:2.4":"paricāremahaṃ tadā. 278.","tha-ap411:3.1":"“Tūriyā āhatā mayhaṃ,","tha-ap411:3.2":"sammatāḷasamāhitā;","tha-ap411:3.3":"Naccantā [rañjantī (syā.), rajjantā (ka.)] itthiyo sabbā,","tha-ap411:3.4":"harantiyeva me mano. 279.","tha-ap411:4.1":"“Celāpikā [celāvakā (syā.), velāmikā (pī.)] lāmaṇikā [vāmanikā (syā. pī.)], kuñjavāsī timajjhikā [kuñjavā sīhimajjhitā (syā.), kujjā vā sīhimajjhikā (pī.)];","tha-ap411:4.3":"Laṅghikā sokajjhāyī ca,","tha-ap411:4.4":"parivārenti maṃ sadā. 280.","tha-ap411:5.1":"“Vetāḷino kumbhathūnī,","tha-ap411:5.2":"naṭā ca naccakā bahū;","tha-ap411:5.3":"Naṭakā nāṭakā ceva,","tha-ap411:5.4":"parivārenti maṃ sadā. 281.","tha-ap411:6.1":"“Kappakā nhāpakā sūdā,","tha-ap411:6.2":"mālākārā supāsakā [sumāpakā (sī. syā.)];","tha-ap411:6.3":"Jallā mallā ca te sabbe,","tha-ap411:6.4":"parivārenti maṃ sadā. 282.","tha-ap411:7.1":"“Etesu kīḷamānesu,","tha-ap411:7.2":"sikkhite katupāsane;","tha-ap411:7.3":"Rattindivaṃ na jānāmi,","tha-ap411:7.4":"indova tidasaṅgaṇe. 283.","tha-ap411:8.1":"“Addhikā pathikā sabbe,","tha-ap411:8.2":"yācakā varakā bahū;","tha-ap411:8.3":"Upagacchanti te niccaṃ,","tha-ap411:8.4":"bhikkhayantā mamaṃ gharaṃ. 284.","tha-ap411:9.1":"“Samaṇā brāhmaṇā ceva,","tha-ap411:9.2":"puññakkhettā anuttarā;","tha-ap411:9.3":"Vaḍḍhayantā mamaṃ puññaṃ,","tha-ap411:9.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 285.","tha-ap411:10.1":"“Paṭagā [paṭakā (sī. syā.), padakā (pī.)] laṭukā [laṭakā (sī.)] sabbe,","tha-ap411:10.2":"nigaṇṭhā pupphasāṭakā;","tha-ap411:10.3":"Tedaṇḍikā ekasikhā,","tha-ap411:10.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 286.","tha-ap411:11.1":"“Ājīvakā viluttāvī,","tha-ap411:11.2":"godhammā devadhammikā;","tha-ap411:11.3":"Rajojalladharā ete,","tha-ap411:11.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 287.","tha-ap411:12.1":"“Parittakā santipattā [parivattakā siddhipattā (sī. syā. pī.)],","tha-ap411:12.2":"kodhapugganikā [koṇḍapuggaṇikā (sī.), koṇḍapuggalikā (pī.)] bahū;","tha-ap411:12.3":"Tapassī vanacārī ca,","tha-ap411:12.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 288.","tha-ap411:13.1":"“Oḍḍakā damiḷā ceva,","tha-ap411:13.2":"sākuḷā malavāḷakā [malayālakā (sī. syā. pī.)];","tha-ap411:13.3":"Savarā yonakā ceva,","tha-ap411:13.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 289.","tha-ap411:14.1":"“Andhakā muṇḍakā sabbe,","tha-ap411:14.2":"koṭalā hanuvindakā [kolakā sānuvindakā (sī. pī.)];","tha-ap411:14.3":"Ārāvacīnaraṭṭhā ca,","tha-ap411:14.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 290.","tha-ap411:15.1":"“Alasandakā [alasantā (ka.)] pallavakā,","tha-ap411:15.2":"dhammarā niggamānusā [babbarā bhaggakārusā (sī.)];","tha-ap411:15.3":"Gehikā [rohitā (sī.), bāhikā (pī.)] cetaputtā ca,","tha-ap411:15.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 291.","tha-ap411:16.1":"“Mādhurakā kosalakā,","tha-ap411:16.2":"kaliṅgā [kāsikā (sī.)] hatthiporikā;","tha-ap411:16.3":"Isiṇḍā makkalā ceva,","tha-ap411:16.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 292.","tha-ap411:17.1":"“Celāvakā ārabbhā [arammā (sī. pī.)] ca,","tha-ap411:17.2":"oghuḷhā [okkalā (sī.)] meghalā bahū;","tha-ap411:17.3":"Khuddakā suddakā ceva,","tha-ap411:17.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 293.","tha-ap411:18.1":"“Rohaṇā sindhavā ceva,","tha-ap411:18.2":"citakā ekakaṇṇikā;","tha-ap411:18.3":"Suraṭṭhā aparantā ca,","tha-ap411:18.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 294.","tha-ap411:19.1":"“Suppārakā kumārā [kikumārā (sī. pī.)] ca,","tha-ap411:19.2":"mallasovaṇṇabhūmikā [malayā soṇṇabhūmikā (sī. syā. pī.)];","tha-ap411:19.3":"Vajjītaṅgā [vajjī tārā (sī.), vajjīhārā (syā. pī.)] ca te sabbe,","tha-ap411:19.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 295.","tha-ap411:20.1":"“Naḷakārā pesakārā,","tha-ap411:20.2":"cammakārā ca tacchakā;","tha-ap411:20.3":"Kammārā kumbhakārā ca,","tha-ap411:20.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 296.","tha-ap411:21.1":"“Maṇikārā lohakārā,","tha-ap411:21.2":"soṇṇakārā ca dussikā;","tha-ap411:21.3":"Tipukārā ca te sabbe,","tha-ap411:21.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 297.","tha-ap411:22.1":"“Usukārā bhamakārā,","tha-ap411:22.2":"pesakārā ca gandhikā;","tha-ap411:22.3":"Rajakā tunnavāyā ca,","tha-ap411:22.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 298.","tha-ap411:23.1":"“Telikā kaṭṭhahārā ca,","tha-ap411:23.2":"udahārā ca pessikā;","tha-ap411:23.3":"Sūpikā sūparakkhā ca,","tha-ap411:23.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 299.","tha-ap411:24.1":"“Dovārikā anīkaṭṭhā,","tha-ap411:24.2":"bandhikā [vandikā (sī.), ganthikā (syā.), sandikā (pī.)] pupphachaḍḍakā;","tha-ap411:24.3":"Hatthāruhā hatthipālā,","tha-ap411:24.4":"āgacchanti mamaṃ gharaṃ. 300.","tha-ap411:25.1":"“Ānandassa mahārañño [ānandassa nāma rañño (syā.), arindamanāma rañño (pī.)],","tha-ap411:25.2":"mamatthassa [pamattassa (sī. pī.), samaggassa (syā.)] adāsahaṃ;","tha-ap411:25.3":"Sattavaṇṇena ratanena,","tha-ap411:25.4":"ūnatthaṃ [ūnattaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)] pūrayāmahaṃ. 301.","tha-ap411:26.1":"“Ye mayā kittitā sabbe,","tha-ap411:26.2":"nānāvaṇṇā bahū janā;","tha-ap411:26.3":"Tesāhaṃ cittamaññāya,","tha-ap411:26.4":"tappayiṃ ratanenahaṃ. 302.","tha-ap411:27.1":"“Vaggūsu bhāsamānāsu,","tha-ap411:27.2":"vajjamānāsu bherisu;","tha-ap411:27.3":"Saṅkhesu dhamayantesu,","tha-ap411:27.4":"sakagehe ramāmahaṃ. 303.","tha-ap411:28.1":"“Bhagavā tamhi samaye,","tha-ap411:28.2":"padumuttaranāyako;","tha-ap411:28.3":"Vasīsatasahassehi,","tha-ap411:28.4":"parikkhīṇāsavehi so. 304.","tha-ap411:29.1":"“Bhikkhūhi sahito vīthiṃ,","tha-ap411:29.2":"paṭipajjittha cakkhumā;","tha-ap411:29.3":"Obhāsento disā sabbā,","tha-ap411:29.4":"dīparukkhova jotati. 305.","tha-ap411:30.1":"“Vajjanti bheriyo sabbā,","tha-ap411:30.2":"gacchante lokanāyake;","tha-ap411:30.3":"Pabhā niddhāvate tassa,","tha-ap411:30.4":"sataraṃsīva uggato. 306.","tha-ap411:31.1":"“Kavāṭantarikāyāpi,","tha-ap411:31.2":"paviṭṭhena ca rasminā;","tha-ap411:31.3":"Antogharesu vipulo,","tha-ap411:31.4":"āloko āsi tāvade. 307.","tha-ap411:32.1":"“Pabhaṃ disvāna buddhassa,","tha-ap411:32.2":"pārisajje avocahaṃ;","tha-ap411:32.3":"Nissaṃsayaṃ buddhaseṭṭho,","tha-ap411:32.4":"imaṃ vīthimupāgato. 308.","tha-ap411:33.1":"“Khippaṃ oruyha pāsādā,","tha-ap411:33.2":"agamiṃ antarāpaṇaṃ;","tha-ap411:33.3":"Sambuddhaṃ abhivādetvā,","tha-ap411:33.4":"idaṃ vacanamabraviṃ. 309.","tha-ap411:34.1":"“‘Anukampatu me buddho,","tha-ap411:34.2":"jalajuttamanāyako;","tha-ap411:34.3":"Vasīsatasahassehi,","tha-ap411:34.4":"adhivāsesi so muni’. 310.","tha-ap411:35.1":"“Nimantetvāna sambuddhaṃ,","tha-ap411:35.2":"abhinesiṃ sakaṃ gharaṃ;","tha-ap411:35.3":"Tattha annena pānena,","tha-ap411:35.4":"santappesiṃ mahāmuniṃ. 311.","tha-ap411:36.1":"“Bhuttāviṃ kālamaññāya,","tha-ap411:36.2":"buddhaseṭṭhassa tādino;","tha-ap411:36.3":"Sataṅgikena tūriyena,","tha-ap411:36.4":"buddhaseṭṭhaṃ upaṭṭhahiṃ. 312.","tha-ap411:37.1":"“Padumuttaro lokavidū,","tha-ap411:37.2":"āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;","tha-ap411:37.3":"Antoghare nisīditvā,","tha-ap411:37.4":"imā gāthā abhāsatha. 313.","tha-ap411:38.1":"“‘Yo maṃ tūriyehupaṭṭhāsi,","tha-ap411:38.2":"annapānañcadāsi me;","tha-ap411:38.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi,","tha-ap411:38.4":"suṇātha mama bhāsato. 314.","tha-ap411:39.1":"“‘Pahūtabhakkho hutvāna,","tha-ap411:39.2":"sahirañño sabhojano;","tha-ap411:39.3":"Catudīpe ekarajjaṃ,","tha-ap411:39.4":"kārayissatiyaṃ naro. 315.","tha-ap411:40.1":"“‘Pañcasīle samādāya,","tha-ap411:40.2":"dasakammapathe tato;","tha-ap411:40.3":"Samādāya pavattento,","tha-ap411:40.4":"parisaṃ sikkhāpayissati. 316.","tha-ap411:41.1":"“‘Tūriyasatasahassāni,","tha-ap411:41.2":"bheriyo samalaṅkatā;","tha-ap411:41.3":"Vajjayissantimaṃ niccaṃ,","tha-ap411:41.4":"upaṭṭhānassidaṃ phalaṃ. 317.","tha-ap411:42.1":"“‘Tiṃsakappasahassāni,","tha-ap411:42.2":"devaloke ramissati;","tha-ap411:42.3":"Catusaṭṭhikkhattuṃ devindo,","tha-ap411:42.4":"devarajjaṃ karissati. 318.","tha-ap411:43.1":"“‘Catusaṭṭhikkhattuṃ rājā,","tha-ap411:43.2":"cakkavattī bhavissati;","tha-ap411:43.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ,","tha-ap411:43.4":"gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ. 319.","tha-ap411:44.1":"“‘Kappasatasahassamhi,","tha-ap411:44.2":"okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap411:44.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena,","tha-ap411:44.4":"satthā loke bhavissati. 320.","tha-ap411:45.1":"“‘Upapajjati yaṃ yoniṃ,","tha-ap411:45.2":"devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","tha-ap411:45.3":"Anūnabhogo hutvāna,","tha-ap411:45.4":"manussattaṃ gamissati. 321.","tha-ap411:46.1":"“‘Ajjhāyako bhavitvāna,","tha-ap411:46.2":"tiṇṇaṃ vedāna pāragū;","tha-ap411:46.3":"Uttamatthaṃ gavesanto,","tha-ap411:46.4":"carissati mahiṃ imaṃ. 322.","tha-ap411:47.1":"“‘So pacchā pabbajitvāna,","tha-ap411:47.2":"sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap411:47.3":"Gotamassa bhagavato,","tha-ap411:47.4":"sāsanebhiramissati. 323.","tha-ap411:48.1":"“‘Ārādhayitvāna sambuddhaṃ,","tha-ap411:48.2":"gotamaṃ sakyapuṅgavaṃ;","tha-ap411:48.3":"Kilese jhāpayitvāna,","tha-ap411:48.4":"arahāyaṃ bhavissati’. 324.","tha-ap411:49.1":"“Vipine byaggharājāva,","tha-ap411:49.2":"migarājāva kesarī;","tha-ap411:49.3":"Abhīto viharāmajja,","tha-ap411:49.4":"sakyaputtassa sāsane. 325.","tha-ap411:50.1":"“Devaloke manusse vā,","tha-ap411:50.2":"dalidde duggatimhi vā;","tha-ap411:50.3":"Nibbattiṃ me na passāmi,","tha-ap411:50.4":"upaṭṭhānassidaṃ phalaṃ. 326.","tha-ap411:51.1":"“Vivekamanuyuttomhi,","tha-ap411:51.2":"upasanto nirūpadhi;","tha-ap411:51.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā,","tha-ap411:51.4":"viharāmi anāsavo. 327.","tha-ap411:52.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe…","tha-ap411:52.3":"viharāmi anāsavo. 328.","tha-ap411:53.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi…pe…","tha-ap411:53.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ. 329.","tha-ap411:54.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso…pe…","tha-ap411:54.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap411:55.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā jatukaṇṇitthero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap411:56.1":"Jatukaṇṇittherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ. 10."},"unsure":["tha-ap411:4.1"],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3327,"to":3327,"paras":[{"para":3327,"vripara":"276","refs":["tha-ap411:1"],"lines":["Navamāpadāne <b>nagare haṃsavatiyā</b>tiādikaṃ āyasmato jatukaṇṇittherassa apadānaṃ.","Tattha seṭṭhiputto hutvā suvaṇṇapāsāde vasanabhāvo ca pañcahi kāmaguṇehi samaṅgī hutvā vasanabhāvo ca sabbadesavāsīnaṃ sabbasippaviññūnañca āgantvā sevanabhāvo ca viseso. 330."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap411:1"],["tha-ap411:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap411:1.1","nagare haṃsavatiyā",0,0]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
